    "message": "Hash world divergence samples through the history cache\n\nThe first-divergence query in world mode built world.to_dict() for every\nbranch at every scanned minute and hashed it again, encoding the whole\nworld twice per sample. Each branch's replay now hashes its minutes with\nthe history cache of Checkpoint saves (#44), seeded with the EventLog it\nstarts from (#241), which gives digest(world.to_dict()) from only what\neach minute added. A test ties the hashes to each branch's world digest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
